<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian April unemployment eases to 14.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Slovenian April unemployment eases to 14.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	April     March     April 96</p>
<p>    Percentage			 14.3	14.4	13.8</p>
<p>    Total			   123,780   124,244     119,938</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
